# hoisted (not pnpm's default isolated linker) so every app resolves the
# SAME react/react-dom install — required for react-dom to work at all across
# apps/admin, apps/web, apps/mobile in this workspace. Root package.json pins
# react/react-dom to an exact version (18.3.1, not a ^range) on purpose: with
# hoisting, a version range could let two apps' installs resolve to different
# patch versions and silently duplicate React, breaking hooks. Every
# consumer's own package.json still declares its own ^18.2.0-style range for
# documentation/compatibility; the root pin is what actually wins.
node-linker=hoisted
